Text_SeismicTossTeach::
    .string "Most of what was built is gone.\p"
    .string "We keep what we can and label the\n"
    .string "rest unknown.\p"
    .string "That should make you look harder,\n"
    .string "not look away.\p"
    .string "Speaking of which. Shall I teach\n"
    .string "one of yours SEISMIC TOSS?$"

Text_SeismicTossDeclined::
    .string "No?\n"
    .string "You will be back.$"

Text_SeismicTossWhichMon::
    .string "Which one wants it?$"

Text_SeismicTossTaught::
    .string "Keep looking.\n"
    .string "That is the whole of the method.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_WhatsSpecialAboutMoonStone::
    .string "A MOON STONE.\p"
    .string "It looks like a rock to me.\p"
    .string "They say it changes what a daemon\n"
    .string "compiles to. I do not see how.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_BoughtColorTVForMoonLanding::
    .string "I bought a colour set to watch it\n"
    .string "go up.\p"
    .string "We all saw the same picture at the\n"
    .string "same moment.\p"
    .string "That had never happened before.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_RunningSpaceExhibitThisMonth::
    .string "The upstairs exhibit changes every\n"
    .string "month.\p"
    .string "This one is about distance.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_AskedDaddyToCatchPikachu::
    .string "I want a SPIKE.\p"
    .string "Dad says they are hard to keep\n"
    .string "bound. I do not care.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_PikachuSoonIPromise::
    .string "A SPIKE. Soon.\n"
    .string "I did promise.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_SpaceShuttle::
    .string "SHUTTLE MODEL. Scale 1:144.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_MeteoriteThatFellOnMtMoon::
    .string "A stone that fell on Deadstack.\p"
    .string "It is thought to be a MOON STONE.\n"
    .string "Nobody has taken it apart.$"

